B.ePd=s(["Your case data is stored in our Supabase project in the us-west-1 region (Oregon, United States).","The web app itself is served from Vercel\u2019s global edge network, so page loads may be served from the edge location nearest you.","AI analysis (Gemini) and transcription (Deepgram) are processed in those providers\u2019 clouds; only the content you explicitly send for analysis or transcription leaves the primary region."],t.s)
B.ePh=s(["Evidence files are encrypted on your device with XChaCha20-Poly1305 before upload. Supabase Storage holds only ciphertext \u2014 it cannot read your files.","Each case room has its own data key. The key itself is never stored in our database \u2014 only an opaque identifier is recorded.","The data key is wrapped separately for every member using X25519 key exchange, so each member can unwrap it only with their own private key. Private keys never leave your device.","Key rotation: room owners can rotate the room data key at any time. When a member is removed, their key envelopes can be revoked so they cannot read evidence encrypted after rotation.","Each encrypted upload records the SHA-256 hash of the plaintext, so your device can verify a decrypted file is exactly what was uploaded."],t.s)
