B.fCw=new A.a1d("demo-harborview-incident-summary.md","# Harborview Marina \u2014 Incident Summary\n\n**Case:** Demo: Harborview Heist\n**Reported:** 2026-10-09, 03:05 by marina night guard\n**What happened:** Sometime between 02:00 and 03:00, the marina office\nwas broken into. A safe containing the weekend's mooring fees\n(approx. $4,200) was forced open, and two handheld radios are missing.\n\n**Scene notes:**\n- Side gate found ajar; no sign of forced entry on the main door.\n- North-gate security camera went offline at 02:14 (storm in the area).\n- Alarm triggered at the fuel dock at 02:31.\n\n**Status:** Demo evidence \u2014 explore the vault, timeline and AI analysis\nto see how a CaseThread room works.\n")
B.fCx=new A.a1d("demo-harborview-witness-statement.md",'# Witness Statement \u2014 R. Alvarez (dockhand)\n\n**Taken:** 2026-10-09, 07:40 by the night guard\n\n> "I was securing the lines on pier C around quarter to three when I\n> heard a van door slide shut near the north lot. Dark van, no plates\n> I could make out. It pulled out fast toward Harborview Road. I\n> didn\'t see faces \u2014 it was raining hard."\n\n**Investigator note (demo):** Statement is uncorroborated. Cross-check\nagainst the 02:14 camera outage and the 02:31 fuel-dock alarm on the\ntimeline.\n')
